<title>ESTONIA: MEN'S BASKETBALL RESULTS MARCH 21-23.</title>
<headline>MEN'S BASKETBALL RESULTS MARCH 21-23.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian men's basketball</p>
<p>association semifinal results from games at the weekend:</p>
<p>FRIDAY, MARCH 21</p>
<p>Nybit - Kamee 80:71 (35:40)</p>
<p>BC Tallinn - KK Tartu  70:71 (32:32)</p>
<p>KK Baltika - BC Kalev  92:82 (50:45)</p>
<p>SATURDAY, MARCH 22</p>
<p>BC Tallinn - KK Tartu  92:82 (37:36)</p>
<p>KK Baltika - BC Kalev 114:82 (82:28)</p>
<p>The next games are on March 25, 28 and 29.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
